## What this is

A fan-built, non-commercial Destiny text archive distributed as one SQLite
database, plus optional read-only tools and six character personas that read it.
Every searchable row keeps the provenance available at build time. Quote
verification checks whether a line exists in this library with the attribution
supplied.

## What it is not

- Not official Bungie material and not affiliated with or endorsed by Bungie.
- Not a complete archive of every line, item, audio file, localisation or build.
- Not a subtitle track: caption-tier rows come from string banks that mix
  dialogue, narration and objectives; their `kind` label is a heuristic.
- Not era-pure: a missing timeline stays unknown; season, act and expansion are
  never inferred from wording.
- Not a speaker guesser: a speaker is used only from in-string attribution, a
  verified caption source or an alias.
- A passing `verify` means the text is in this corpus; it does not mean Bungie
  published it in that form, that it is current live dialogue, or that it is the
  only version.

